{"id":286,"gn":"Pokémon Champignon","ft":["Ses petits bras s’étendent quand il donne un coup de poing. Son talent égale celui d’un boxeur pro.","Il frappe de toutes ses forces ses ennemis étourdis par ses spores empoisonnées.","Chapignon se rapproche de son ennemi en se servant de son jeu de jambes, puis donne des coups de poing avec ses bras élastiques. La technique de combat de ce Pokémon est digne des meilleurs boxeurs.","Les graines autour de la queue de Chapignon sont des spores toxiques. Elles sont totalement immangeables. Une simple bouchée d’une graine de ce Pokémon peut causer de grandes douleurs à l’estomac."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":0,"24":1,"25":2,"26":3},"gr":4,"cr":90,"hc":15,"bh":70,"eg":["Féerique","Végétal"],"gw":"fast-then-very-slow","gm":{"sv":[0,107],"oras":[0,36],"e":[0,35],"rs":[0,35]},"f":{"286":{"n":"Chapignon","t":["grass","fighting"],"s":[60,130,80,60,60,70],"h":1.2,"w":39.2,"a":[[27,0],[90,0],[101,1]],"pa":[[3,[[27,0]]],[4,[[27,0],[90,0]]]],"av":["sv","oras","e","rs"],"hi":[[86,50,[25,26,27,28,29,30]],[87,5,[25,26,27,28,29,30]],[167,5,[12,13,14,15,16,17,18,21,22]]],"ls":[{"l":[[183,0],[78,1],[33,1],[71,1],[73,1],[74,1],[77,1],[92,1],[72,12],[29,15],[364,19],[68,22],[395,28],[388,33],[280,39],[402,44],[223,50],[264,55]],"m":[9,14,34,36,63,67,76,91,92,129,156,157,164,179,182,188,189,202,203,204,206,214,240,241,263,264,270,280,313,317,331,332,339,341,345,370,374,398,402,409,411,412,416,428,437,441,444,447,474,490,523,580,851,884]},{"l":[[71,1],[33,1],[78,1],[73,1],[78,5],[73,8],[72,12],[29,15],[364,19],[68,22],[183,23],[395,28],[170,33],[327,39],[402,44],[223,50]],"m":[14,15,63,70,76,92,104,148,156,157,164,182,188,206,207,213,214,216,218,219,237,241,249,263,280,290,317,339,374,411,412,416,444,447,474,490,496,514,590,612],"t":[9,173,202,231,235,264,270,276,289,388,402,409]},{"l":[[71,1],[33,1],[78,1],[73,1],[33,4],[78,7],[73,10],[72,16],[29,22],[183,23],[68,28],[327,36],[170,45],[223,54]],"m":[15,63,70,76,92,104,148,156,182,188,202,213,216,21